{"version":1,"content":"<p>據報道，蘋果公司此前向多名泰國政界人士的iPhone發送了間諜軟件威脅警報，引發泰國政府高度關注。為進一步了解相關情況並加強網絡安全防護，泰國數字經濟與社會部已與蘋果公司代表舉行會談。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585954.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T13:38:57.025749+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T13:22:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T13:32:15.793678+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T13:32:15.793678+00:00","content_hash":"26d33a3e8d7959767c852d1b1e55fccb575433c2bb1aecb2a376ffe60efea149","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}